    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d7ff811d268baeb2077801ce",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "听了生野狄杜斯的话后，我点头称是。\n看来她……并非如铁一般冰冷的赛马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "04c7c9f45d3b950a5ae50c5e6c2b87a46e05b24173bf05f3dbf789855830fcfa",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
